# Review-round-1 comment fixes for the two .github/workflows files, which the
# machine account cannot push (its PAT lacks the workflows permission; the
# Actions token can never modify workflow files). To land them:
#   git apply workflow-comments.patch && git rm workflow-comments.patch
# then commit and push. Delete this file either way - it is a handoff
# artifact, not part of the change.
diff --git a/.github/workflows/claude-review-stub.yml b/.github/workflows/claude-review-stub.yml
index 2ebdd28..5913f91 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/claude-review-stub.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/claude-review-stub.yml
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
